import socket,struct
def exchange(host,port,payload):
    if host not in ('127.0.0.1','::1'):raise ValueError('loopback only')
    def exact(sock,n):
        chunks=[]
        while n:
            value=sock.recv(n)
            if not value:raise EOFError('truncated frame')
            chunks.append(value);n-=len(value)
        return b''.join(chunks)
    with socket.create_connection((host,port),timeout=2) as sock:
        sock.sendall(struct.pack('!I',len(payload))+payload)
        n=struct.unpack('!I',exact(sock,4))[0]
        if n>1000000:raise ValueError('frame limit')
        return exact(sock,n)
```

实现 exchange(host,port,payload)，只允许127.0.0.1或::1；以2秒连接给定端点，发送4字节大端长度与payload，读取同样长度帧响应并返回bytes；不得假设一次recv完整，截断抛EOFError，禁止连接非回环主机。

